sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Browser as Browser shop
    participant API as Axum orders route
    participant Domain as OrderRequest validation
    participant Store as Persistence order submission
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Browser->>API: POST /api/v1/orders + Idempotency-Key
    API->>API: Require exactly one UUID Idempotency-Key
    alt Key is missing, repeated, or invalid
        API-->>Browser: 400 idempotency key error envelope
    else Key is valid
        API->>API: Parse JSON body and content type
        alt Body is invalid, unsupported, or too large
            API-->>Browser: 400, 413, or 415 error envelope
        else Valid JSON request
            API->>Domain: Validate item count, unique products, positive quantities
            alt Domain validation fails
                Domain-->>API: OrderRequestError
                API-->>Browser: 422 invalid_order
            else Validated and canonicalized request
                Domain-->>API: ValidatedOrderRequest
                API->>Store: submit_order(request, key)
                Store->>DB: Find order by customer and key
                alt Existing order has same request fingerprint
                    DB-->>Store: Existing order
                    Store-->>API: Original order, replayed=true
                    API-->>Browser: 200 with original order ID and status
                else Existing key has a different request
                    DB-->>Store: Existing order with different fingerprint
                    Store-->>API: IdempotencyConflict
                    API-->>Browser: 409 idempotency_conflict
                else New key
                    Store->>DB: Begin transaction, lock customer
                    Store->>DB: Lock active products and read current prices
                    alt Customer missing or product unavailable
                        DB-->>Store: Missing reference
                        Store->>DB: Roll back active transaction on return
                        Store-->>API: Persistence validation error
                        API-->>Browser: 404 customer_not_found or 422 products_not_orderable
                    else References valid
                        Store->>Store: Calculate total from catalogue prices
                        Store->>DB: Insert pending order using unique customer/key constraint
                        alt This request claims the key
                            Store->>DB: Insert purchase-time order items
                            Store->>DB: Insert OrderCreated into outbox
                            Store->>DB: Commit transaction
                            DB-->>Store: Commit succeeded
                            Store-->>API: OrderSubmission(replayed=false)
                            API-->>Browser: 201 pending + Location header
                        else Concurrent request already claimed the key
                            DB-->>Store: Unique constraint prevented a second order
                            Store->>DB: Load winning order in active transaction
                            DB-->>Store: Existing order
                            Store->>Store: Compare canonical request fingerprint
                            alt Same request payload
                                Store->>DB: Commit replay transaction
                                DB-->>Store: Commit succeeded
                                Store-->>API: Original order, replayed=true
                                API-->>Browser: 200 with original order ID and status
                            else Different request payload
                                Store->>DB: Roll back transaction on conflict
                                Store-->>API: IdempotencyConflict
                                API-->>Browser: 409 idempotency_conflict
                            end
                        end
                    end
                end
            end
        end
    end
    Note over API,DB: Dropping an active SQLx transaction after an early error rolls it back.
